    exampleHands: [
      'Opening deal: 2-4 player(s), 5 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in play; each_player_clockwise may use play_card before round end.',
      "Scoring check: Basic scoring: Win 1 unit for each corresponding hand you beat, lose 1 unit for each hand that beats you. Special hands: Three of a kind in front wins 3 units instead of 1. Full house in middle wins 2 units. Four of a kind in back/middle wins 4 units. Royal/straight flush in back/middle wins 5 units. Special 13-card hands win automatically: Six pairs (3 units), Three straights (3 units), Three flushes (3 units), Complete straight A-K (13 units). Expected outcome: Arrange 13 cards into three poker hands (back: 5 cards, middle: 5 cards, front: 3 cards) where back ≥ middle ≥ front in strength. Win units by beating opponents' corresponding hands..",
